title: Pirates on the Rim
subtitle: Raiders are preying on Rim trade lanes.
tags: event
view-if: rim_hardship >= 38 and piracy_timer <= 0 and time >= 2 and not war and not finale
new-page: true
face-image: img/ev_rim.svg
on-arrival: {! Q.piracy_timer = 6 + Math.floor(Math.random() * 4); Q.rim_hardship += 2; Q.outer_sep += 1; Q.trade -= 6; !}

= Pirates on the Rim

A pirate fleet has sacked a convoy in the Outer Rim, killing hundreds. Rim senators ask, again, why the Republic cannot protect its own citizens.

- @judicials: Demand that the Judicial Forces respond.
- @relief: Fund relief for the victims.
- @blame: Blame the Chancellery's neglect.

@judicials
subtitle: The Security Bloc approves; Rim hardship eases a little.
on-arrival: judicial_forces += 0.2; rim_hardship -= 2; sec_relation += 3; trade += 4

Judicial cruisers hunt down the raiders, eventually.

@relief
subtitle: −1 political capital. The Rim notices.
choose-if: capital >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough political capital.
on-arrival: capital -= 1; rim_hardship -= 2; outer_rc += 1.5; outer_sep -= 1.5

Caucus relief reaches the survivors within days.

@blame
subtitle: Hurts the government, helps us, and fuels Rim anger.
on-arrival: rc_momentum += 0.6; outer_sep += 1; faith -= 0.5

"While the Chancellery debates procedure, the Rim bleeds," declares Onaconda Farr.
